# Added by ggshield
.cache_ggshield

# Runtime state — NEVER commit (issue #191). runtime/bot.db and
# data/acp.db are the bot's live multi-tenant credential store
# (guilds.adapter_token, KEK/DEK secret tables). A tracked database
# here means one `git add -A` on a deployed machine pushes live
# per-operator adapter tokens to GitHub.
runtime/
data/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
